  "mod": {
    "success": true,
    "data": {
      "id": 1768,
      "hub_id": 2403,
      "guid": "com.rcta.metalgear",
      "name": "RCTA - Metal Gear [FORTNITE]",
      "slug": "rcta-metal-gear-fortnite",
      "teaser": "The Metal Gear collab outfits from Fortnite (but not cringe)",
      "thumbnail": "https://forge-static.sp-tarkov.com/mods/2403.png",
      "downloads": 3388,
      "favourites_count": 2,
      "description": "<h3>**RCTA - Metal Gear [FORTNITE]</h3>\n<p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://i.imgur.com/ESpm0Ic.gif\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ESpm0Ic.gif\" alt=\"ESpm0Ic.gif\" /></a>**</p>\n<p><strong>Mod Description</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Basically every outfit (excluding the masks) from the Metal Gear Fortnite collab, I know “fortnite” leaves a bad taste but don’t let it scare you away, they’re modeled beautifully and I made sure the proportions fit perfectly to the Tarkov body. The textures left untouched fit perfectly fine too! METAL GEAR!!!</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Mod Includes</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>RCTA Old Snake [Top] (BEAR/USEC) (RAGMAN)</strong></li>\n<li><strong>RCTA Old Snake [Bottom] (BEAR/USEC) (RAGMAN)</strong></li>\n<li><strong>RCTA Raiden [Top] (BEAR/USEC) (RAGMAN)</strong></li>\n<li><strong>RCTA Raiden [Bottom] (BEAR/USEC) (RAGMAN)</strong></li>\n<li><strong>RCTA Snake Top [Top] (BEAR/USEC) (RAGMAN)</strong></li>\n<li><strong>RCTA Snake Top [Bottom] (BEAR/USEC) (RAGMAN)</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Support</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Check out my other work on my <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://www.patreon.com/TRAPPUSSY\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">https://www.patreon.com/TRAPPUSSY</a></li>\n<li>Donate or maybe look into commissions on my <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://ko-fi.com/trappucci\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">https://ko-fi.com/trappucci</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Credits</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Fortnite, Epic Games, People Can Fly</li>\n<li>GrooveypenguinX for framework</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Media</strong></p>\n",
      "detail_url": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/1768/rcta-metal-gear-fortnite",
